{"id":"0c0fb68cd36bfc03","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-nonmonotone-operator.md","title":"Nonmonotone Operator","display":"df-nonmonotone-operator — Nonmonotone Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-nonmonotone-operator","aliases":["18-df-nonmonotone-operator","18-df-069"],"display":"df-nonmonotone-operator — Nonmonotone Operator","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]"],"source_work":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)","source_section":"§13.1 introductory synopsis","source_printed_pages":"333","source_pdf_pages":"341","verification_status":"local-definition-source-context","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_review":"未逐项复核原书证明","content_revision":"2026-10-14","content_review_scope":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-nonmonotone-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-nonmonotone-operator</span><span>18-df-069</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nonmonotone-operator — Nonmonotone Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_work","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.1 introductory synopsis"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"333"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"341"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-definition-source-context"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"未逐项复核原书证明"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span> 是任意算子，不假定由正公式给出。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonMonotone}\">\\(\\mathrm{NonMonotone}\\)</span> 是本式定义的算子谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\">\\(S,T\\)</span> 的量词范围均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span> 为其幂集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonMonotone}(\\Gamma)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists S,T\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\,\n[S\\subseteq T\\land\n\\exists n\\in\\Gamma(S)\\ (n\\notin\\Gamma(T))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NonMonotone}(\\Gamma)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists S,T\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\,\n[S\\subseteq T\\land\n\\exists n\\in\\Gamma(S)\\ (n\\notin\\Gamma(T))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是对原书 Chapter 13 所讨论的一般算子的本地谓词记号。旧稿把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonMonotone}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{NonMonotone}(A)\\)</span> 接到仅允许正公式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_A\">\\(\\Gamma_A\\)</span> 上；正公式诱导单调算子，因此该接口不能表示所要研究的非单调情形。</p>\n<p>算子取一般输入时，仍可用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1617e481ba305017\" href=\"?note=1617e481ba305017\" title=\"18-df-nonmonotone-stages\">18-df-nonmonotone-stages</a> 的累积阶段得到膨胀算子的固定点。这样的固定点不能自动视为原算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 的固定点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega$ 取 [[18-df-ordinal]]；$\\mathcal P(\\omega)$ 为其幂集。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-nonmonotone-stages","status":"resolved","id":"1617e481ba305017","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"算子取一般输入时，仍可用 [[18-df-nonmonotone-stages]] 的累积阶段得到膨胀算子的固定点。这样的固定点不能自动视为原算子 $\\Gamma$ 的固定点。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NonMonotone}","display":false},{"tex":"S,T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NonMonotone}(\\Gamma)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists S,T\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\,\n[S\\subseteq T\\land\n\\exists n\\in\\Gamma(S)\\ (n\\notin\\Gamma(T))].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NonMonotone}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false}],"bytes":1710,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-135","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-nonmonotone-operator]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-nonmonotone-operator]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-nonmonotone-operator]]"}],"outgoing":["cf95026e035bcb2b","1617e481ba305017"]}